# **ORIGIN SCENERY**

# **COMPLETE VISUAL SYNTHESIS GUIDE**

This document is the master visual guide for the **11 Origins** across the **10 Major Factions**. It utilizes the **CRISP** methodology (Context, Resolution, Intent, Style, Palette) to generate high-fidelity environmental art.

## **GLOBAL CONSTANTS (MANDATORY)**

